{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\"\n       xmlns:acme=\"urn:example:acme\"\n       initial=\"a\">\n  <final id=\"a\">\n    <onentry><acme:beep volume=\"3\"/></onentry>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd001-unregistered-namespace.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd001-unregistered-namespace.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":36,"endLine":2,"startColumn":20,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"cannot resolve an XML Schema for namespace `urn:example:acme`\n\n**Note:** schema lookup uses the exact namespace URI; the SCXML namespace uses the bundled W3C SCXML 1.0 schema by default, and every other namespace used under the strict policy needs an explicitly registered schema\n\n**Help:** register a schema with `--schema urn:example:acme=PATH.xsd`, or validate with `--policy lax` to skip namespaces without a schema\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.10 Extensibility of Executable Content","text":"cannot resolve an XML Schema for namespace `urn:example:acme`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":96,"start":80},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"first use of this namespace"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd001-unregistered-namespace.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":5,"startColumn":15,"startLine":5}}}],"ruleId":"XSD001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"under the `strict` policy every non-built-in namespace must be structurally validated; the SCXML namespace uses the bundled W3C schema by default, extension namespaces need an explicit schema"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: register the namespace's XSD with `--schema URI=PATH`, correct the namespace URI, or use `--policy lax`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §4.10 Extensibility of Executable Content\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XSD001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#extensibility","id":"XSD001","name":"XSD001","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"no XML Schema is registered for a namespace used by the document"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}